+
+    // Papo start - batch 176 (R35): loop twin of IntStream.range(0, n).mapToObj(i -> pos)
+    // covering Count/NoiseBasedCount/NoiseThresholdCount - the count is sampled before
+    // the first emission, exactly like the stream form builds its range eagerly.
+    @Override
